<title>SLOVAKIA: Austrian AEE wins Slovak contract.</title>
<headline>Austrian AEE wins Slovak contract.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak state electricity monopoly Slovenske Elektrarne a.s. (SE) on Thursday signed a 1.2 billion crown contract with Austrian Energy Elin, a subsidiary of VA Technologie, the official Slovak news agency TASR agency said.</p>
<p>It said the contract is for delivery of desulphurisation and denitrisation equipment for the ageing Vojany thermal power plant in eastern Slovakia, which burns low grade coal.</p>
</text>
